        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Found: 23 Jun 2026 &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Fixed: 23 Jun 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="px-5 py-4 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">What changed</p>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>Removed the <code class="bg-gray-100 px-1 rounded">period_start + 4.days</code> fallback — no more fabricated pink band for users who haven't set a period end</li>
          <li>Period day calculation now handles cross-month ranges: if start is in a prior month and end extends into the current month, the correct days in the current month are highlighted</li>
          <li>If only a start date is set (no end), highlighting runs from start to today within the month</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Testing steps</p>
        <ol class="text-sm text-gray-700 space-y-1 list-decimal list-inside">
