          <li>Navigate to the period page showing June — confirm days 1–4 are highlighted in red</li>
          <li>Create a fresh test account with no period end date set — confirm no pink band appears on the calendar</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-green-600 font-medium">&#10003; Expected: cross-month periods highlight correctly; no band when no end date set</p>
      </div>
    </div>
